    "body": "Second occurrence of this fault. Post-merge run 43628244696 (main 058e14ca0) failed at 18:56Z. The gate passed six suites (geometry, cl, tools, post, sim, motion). The app suites, the ui suites, and clippy then died with the sccache error above, before any test ran. Main is not red: no test result failed. The #1691 fix is in this head. PR test runs stay healthy (run 43625166739 succeeded after the first occurrence).\n",
