    "body": "Status update, 2026-11-14 20:1xZ. The runner recovered. Post-merge run 43634372050 (main 101d82f9ddb) completed green at 19:51Z, batch tier, no sccache error. A manual confirm dispatch at 19:54Z (43634597083) failed in its own checkout step because main moved mid-run; that failure is the dispatch race, not a test result and not this fault. Occurrence count on this fault stands at two (43620716239, 43628244696). The fault can still return; reviews keep the local fallback route until a root cause lands.\n",
